sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant V as Vercel proxy
  participant S as Spring Security
  participant G as Google OIDC
  participant D as CineBook database
  U->>V: GET /oauth2/authorization/google
  V->>S: Forward request and public host headers
  S-->>U: Redirect to Google + OAuth state session cookie
  U->>G: Authenticate and consent
  G-->>U: Redirect to public callback with authorization code
  U->>V: GET /login/oauth2/code/google
  V->>S: Forward Cookie and callback
  S->>G: Exchange code and validate ID token
  S->>D: Resolve Google sub and create/link CUSTOMER account
  S->>D: Store hashed short-lived one-time app code
  S-->>U: Redirect to /auth/callback?code=...
  U->>V: POST /api/auth/oauth/exchange
  V->>S: Exchange one-time code
  S->>D: Lock and consume code; rotate refresh record
  S-->>U: Access token JSON + HttpOnly refresh cookie
